 *     <span slot="actions" class="inline-flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-secondary" aria-hidden="true"><img class="dark:brightness-0 dark:invert" src="/figma/hamburger-menu/theme.svg" width="16" height="16" alt="" /></span>
 *     <Button slot="actions" as="a" href="https://github.com/bejamas" variant="secondary" size="sm" aria-label="Bejamas on GitHub, 220 stars"><img class="dark:brightness-0 dark:invert" src="/figma/hamburger-menu/github-header.svg" width="14" height="14" alt="" />220</Button>
