 *     <Button slot="footer" as="a" href="https://github.com/bejamas" variant="secondary" size="icon" aria-label="Bejamas on GitHub"><img class="dark:brightness-0 dark:invert" src="/figma/hamburger-menu/github-footer.svg" width="16" height="16" alt="" /></Button>
